----------------------------------------------------------------------
Message: 1
From: dotmatrix
Subject: [forum] Something is wrong with the recording
Thread: /forum/signals/thread_047.html

I've spent the last few days with CS-0903 in a spectrogram and I've
found things in it that I can't explain as a radio signal received
in the field. I'm not going to post details yet because I could be
wrong and because it isn't fair to do this in public first.
I've told the admins what I found. I'd ask everyone to hold off on
sending the file around, including to the newspaper, until they've
had a chance to look.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Message: 2
From: eward
Subject: Re: [forum] Something is wrong with the recording

Dot is mistaken. Whatever she thinks she sees is from my receiver
and the tape deck. I said in the README the file was cleaned up.
I don't appreciate this being hinted at in public.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Message: 3
From: junebug
Subject: Re: [forum] Something is wrong with the recording

"things she can't explain as a radio signal" = it was NOT a normal
transmission. this is what I've been saying since LANTERN

