@@@ digest-001
type: mail_digest
title: Welcome to lighthouse-l
author: keeper
date: 1997-04-02T20:00:00-08:00
path: /mail/lighthouse-l/welcome.txt
role: flavor
---
Welcome to lighthouse-l, the mailing list of the Lighthouse Network.

Everything posted on the forum is also sent out once a day as a digest,
so you can read along without a web browser. Reply to the list and your
message is posted to the forum for you.

Please keep logs in the Log Book format: time, frequency, mode, location.

Mara (keeper)

